WEBVTT

00:03.211 --> 00:06.005
<i>Causes of death are many and varied.</i>

00:06.089 --> 00:09.634
<i>Old age, suicide, illness…</i>

00:09.718 --> 00:12.178
<i>But the cause of death that scares</i>

00:12.262 --> 00:14.180
<i>the most people in this day and age…</i>

00:17.308 --> 00:18.893
<i>…is death by fire.</i>

00:25.817 --> 00:27.068
This is…

00:27.610 --> 00:28.862
Adolla?

00:29.362 --> 00:30.697
An Adolla Link?

00:34.075 --> 00:36.411
Captain Burns? Why?

00:36.494 --> 00:39.497
May he who has served
the great Sol faithfully

00:39.581 --> 00:42.959
embrace the joy of returning
to the great flame.

00:43.042 --> 00:45.670
The joy of returning to the great flame?

00:45.754 --> 00:46.588
What's that?

00:46.671 --> 00:48.548
Akitaru Obi…

00:49.257 --> 00:50.842
shall receive an insect.

00:56.347 --> 00:58.808
Lieutenant, your orders.

00:58.892 --> 01:01.269
The Imperial Army
will arrive at any minute.

01:01.352 --> 01:03.980
First, we need to leave the station
and find a hiding place.

01:04.564 --> 01:06.941
If that's what you need,
I have just the place.

01:09.235 --> 01:12.530
Take us there. Once there,
we'll assess the situation--

01:12.614 --> 01:13.948
We don't have time for that.

01:15.909 --> 01:16.868
What's wrong, Shinra?

01:17.786 --> 01:20.955
I saw Burns in an Adolla Link.

02:55.049 --> 02:57.927
FORMATION OF COMPANY 8

03:01.180 --> 03:03.892
Most of these can still be used.

03:03.975 --> 03:08.605
Looks like we'll only need to get new
uniforms, equipment, and a Matchbox.

03:12.775 --> 03:15.987
How's your life been
since you left the army?

03:16.070 --> 03:18.406
Not much has changed at all.

03:18.489 --> 03:22.744
On that note, I never asked you
about your personal life.

03:22.827 --> 03:24.537
Do you have a family?

03:24.621 --> 03:29.792
My father raised me as a single parent.
He passed away from illness last year.

03:29.876 --> 03:32.003
Your father…

03:32.795 --> 03:34.672
Do you have a girlfriend?

03:34.756 --> 03:36.132
A girlfriend?

03:36.841 --> 03:41.221
Or do you have a boyfriend?
I'm not prejudiced.

03:41.304 --> 03:43.223
I don't have a girlfriend or a boyfriend.

03:43.306 --> 03:47.227
This is my job. I don't know
when I might die.

03:47.310 --> 03:49.604
I can't consider looking for
that kind of relationship.

03:49.687 --> 03:52.649
That's a real sad way of thinking.

03:52.732 --> 03:54.734
Are you sure
you wanted to come to the 8th?

03:54.817 --> 03:59.948
I didn't think it would be this heretical.
Mind if I quit now?

04:00.698 --> 04:01.532
No quitting.

04:02.450 --> 04:06.037
The 8th is a third party created
to investigate the other companies.

04:06.120 --> 04:08.623
Naturally, they will use
smoke and mirrors on us.

04:09.165 --> 04:12.418
A single man like
me is best fit for the job.

04:12.502 --> 04:17.340
Depending on the circumstances, you may
become an insurgent to the Empire.

04:21.511 --> 04:26.224
That's precisely why we can't
take our own lives lightly.

04:26.307 --> 04:31.521
We need truly strong crewmen who
value others' lives and their own lives.

04:32.939 --> 04:37.485
I'm excited to see what kind
of company the 8th will be!

04:37.568 --> 04:41.364
You're the king and the father
of the company.

04:41.447 --> 04:42.865
That's some pressure.

04:44.993 --> 04:46.703
But you're right.

04:46.786 --> 04:49.831
It's normal to have kids at my age.

04:51.708 --> 04:54.669
I will do my utmost, Captain Obi.

04:55.169 --> 04:59.340
To turn the 8th into a wonderful family.

05:00.049 --> 05:02.176
This is our castle.

05:02.719 --> 05:05.346
We save humanity from this place!

05:16.149 --> 05:17.317
Lieutenant.

05:19.777 --> 05:22.947
The Matchbox is ready to launch.
We can go at any time.

05:23.031 --> 05:24.324
Okay.

05:25.742 --> 05:27.827
We might not come back for a while.

05:29.787 --> 05:32.790
We are going to rescue Captain Obi.

05:32.874 --> 05:33.916
Yes, sir!

05:51.893 --> 05:54.687
How is he? Is he behaving?

05:54.771 --> 05:56.064
You could say that…

06:06.824 --> 06:09.494
He hasn't stopped since we locked him up.

06:10.828 --> 06:13.122
Excuse me! Could I get some water?

06:14.165 --> 06:14.999
Man…

06:20.046 --> 06:21.798
This ain't a restaurant!

06:21.881 --> 06:23.549
Water is only provided
at designated times!

06:23.633 --> 06:26.177
What if I die from dehydration?

06:26.260 --> 06:28.763
Only because you decided to exercise!

06:28.846 --> 06:30.348
It's your own fault.

06:31.182 --> 06:34.519
If you don't let me out soon,
I'll keep exercising out of boredom.

06:34.602 --> 06:38.147
I'll get even more ripped
and stronger than before!

06:44.654 --> 06:46.781
What's going on out there?

06:48.533 --> 06:49.784
The 8th…

06:50.493 --> 06:52.620
Hinawa, they're in your hands.

06:55.414 --> 06:56.415
<i>This is a breaking story.</i>

06:56.499 --> 06:59.460
<i>The captain</i>
<i>of Special Fire Force Company 8,</i>

06:59.544 --> 07:01.921
<i>Akitaru Obi, has been arrested</i>

07:02.004 --> 07:04.465
<i>for abducting and holding</i>
<i>captive Shinra Kusakabe,</i>

07:04.549 --> 07:06.926
<i>possessor of a holy flame</i>
<i>known as an Adolla Burst.</i>

07:07.009 --> 07:11.055
Abducting someone with a holy flame
and holding them captive?

07:11.139 --> 07:13.766
And they're a captain in the Fire Force?

07:13.850 --> 07:14.976
What's the world coming to?

07:15.059 --> 07:16.436
<i>Furthermore, it is believed that</i>

07:16.519 --> 07:18.980
<i>he and his crewmen are in flight</i>
<i>with Shinra Kusakabe in tow.</i>

07:19.063 --> 07:22.400
<i>The Imperial Army is in pursuit of all</i>
<i>crewmen in Special Fire Force Company 8</i>

07:22.483 --> 07:24.902
<i>as key witnesses to the crime.</i>

07:26.529 --> 07:29.699
Who knew the 8th'd be up to no good?

07:29.782 --> 07:30.950
You actually think they would?

07:32.702 --> 07:34.745
Something fishy's going on…

07:36.581 --> 07:38.708
5th Angels Three!

07:38.791 --> 07:40.168
-Complete.
-Successfully put to rest.

07:42.879 --> 07:45.131
Report of a fire in Torigoe District!

07:45.214 --> 07:46.841
Your orders, Princess!

07:46.924 --> 07:49.469
Send the gravel squad immediately.

07:49.552 --> 07:50.636
Crunch!

07:52.346 --> 07:56.976
The 8th vanishes,
their districts are in uproar.

07:57.059 --> 08:00.438
Gravel 8… They only cause trouble.

08:00.521 --> 08:05.735
They pried into our affairs.
You don't seem very happy about it.

08:05.818 --> 08:09.947
And naturally so.
There is less gravel for me to stamp on.

08:10.031 --> 08:13.743
I am concerned for you, Princess.

08:13.826 --> 08:17.205
I believe you have been assisting
the 8th from the shadows.

08:22.460 --> 08:26.422
The 8th are now insurgents
and traitors to the Empire.

08:26.506 --> 08:28.925
The situation has changed.

08:29.008 --> 08:33.137
I pray that you will stop
lending them assistance.

08:43.397 --> 08:47.902
Beni! We got some fresh fish!
How about a drink tonight?

08:49.487 --> 08:50.404
Beni?

08:50.988 --> 08:52.532
What's up with Beni?

08:53.115 --> 08:54.909
Lose at dice again?

09:00.331 --> 09:01.958
Waka! The 8th--

09:02.041 --> 09:03.459
Yeah, I heard.

09:05.253 --> 09:10.675
Just as you feared,
the country's united in a bad way.

09:10.758 --> 09:12.134
Any contact from the 8th?

09:12.218 --> 09:13.386
Nothing.

09:13.886 --> 09:16.347
They must not want
any sparks flying into Asakusa.

09:21.394 --> 09:25.314
The country's turned into
a fire scene full of enemies.

09:34.407 --> 09:35.658
Reporting!

09:35.741 --> 09:38.119
No Company 8 crewmen are on the premises!

09:38.202 --> 09:40.913
What?! Find any eyewitness accounts!

09:40.997 --> 09:42.748
Figure out where they escaped to!

09:42.832 --> 09:46.210
Their only means of transport
is their Matchbox! It's easy to spot!

09:46.294 --> 09:48.754
-Find them at any cost!
-Yes, sir!

10:02.351 --> 10:04.395
We've finished hiding the Matchbox.

10:04.478 --> 10:06.397
They've launched an intense investigation.

10:06.480 --> 10:09.066
It's only a matter of time
before they find us.

10:15.281 --> 10:18.826
What's wrong? Did you only now
figure out how big this problem is?

10:18.909 --> 10:19.910
You regret it now?

10:19.994 --> 10:23.789
I was washed along with my strong
will and went with them…

10:23.873 --> 10:25.374
Your face is scaring me.

10:25.458 --> 10:28.794
The 8th are pros at extinguishing
fires and putting souls to rest,

10:28.878 --> 10:31.839
but amateurs when it
comes to outlaw escape plans.

10:31.922 --> 10:34.467
You act like you know better.

10:34.550 --> 10:37.595
You're just one of Haijima's
corporate slaves.

10:38.179 --> 10:44.644
Remember when the captain asked whether
I was on the side of the 8th or Haijima?

10:45.561 --> 10:48.314
I couldn't answer him back then,

10:48.397 --> 10:50.358
but the truth is, I'm on neither.

10:52.401 --> 10:55.988
In fact, I'm an outlaw
with a certain other individual.

10:56.864 --> 10:59.867
I've been an outlaw
far longer than any of you.

11:06.082 --> 11:07.541
Yo.

11:08.376 --> 11:09.543
Joker?!

11:11.587 --> 11:15.925
You've finally joined us now, Devil.

11:16.008 --> 11:20.554
If the 8th are heroes who fight
human combustion in the public eye,

11:20.638 --> 11:23.099
then we're ones who
fight it in the shadows.

11:24.141 --> 11:26.102
We're dark heroes.

11:26.185 --> 11:29.188
Follow me if you don't want to get caught.

11:29.271 --> 11:32.441
I'll teach you how to shake the baddies.

11:35.111 --> 11:36.987
Wait! We can't trust you!

11:37.071 --> 11:39.407
I know the type of man you are!

11:39.490 --> 11:41.951
You don't have much time, right?

11:42.451 --> 11:45.830
Well, if you want to
get caught, you do you.

11:59.510 --> 12:01.595
You're wearing some worn rags.

12:02.263 --> 12:05.933
The darkness is like my garden.

12:06.016 --> 12:08.644
Naturally, I'd wear
something easy to lounge in.

12:08.727 --> 12:10.813
Where are you taking us?

12:19.321 --> 12:23.200
It took the 8th too long to join us.

12:23.284 --> 12:26.745
You guys are insurgents too now.

12:26.829 --> 12:30.458
It was pretty lonely
with just the two of us.

12:33.502 --> 12:39.383
As an older outlaw, I'll teach you
how to walk through the darkness.

12:41.093 --> 12:42.678
Choose one.

12:43.179 --> 12:44.972
The light circle,

12:45.055 --> 12:47.308
or the dark circle.

12:47.892 --> 12:49.768
Which'll it be?

12:55.733 --> 12:57.985
You don't exactly have a choice.

13:17.254 --> 13:19.548
An unused sewer pipe?

13:20.466 --> 13:23.552
How do you live in a place like this?

13:23.636 --> 13:26.889
Our secret base has
air conditioning. It doesn't smell.

13:27.389 --> 13:29.183
SECRET BASE

13:29.266 --> 13:32.061
You don't keep it very secret…

13:32.144 --> 13:36.815
This place isn't on any maps.
It's forgotten to the world.

13:36.899 --> 13:37.733
BEWARE OF DOG

13:37.816 --> 13:39.026
You have a cerberus?

13:39.109 --> 13:40.110
No.

13:40.611 --> 13:41.862
Oh…

13:42.446 --> 13:45.866
It's somewhat rare,
but sometimes people other than us

13:45.950 --> 13:49.119
who have no place on the surface
come down here too.

13:52.039 --> 13:54.500
Come on in. Welcome to our castle.

14:00.172 --> 14:03.050
You've got a lot of
creepy stuff lying around.

14:03.133 --> 14:04.385
What is this?

14:06.136 --> 14:09.515
I understand that you're wary,
but please trust us.

14:09.598 --> 14:14.979
It may not seem like it,
but Joker and I trust you in the 8th.

14:17.398 --> 14:22.027
So? The question's what you're
gonna do from here on, but…

14:22.111 --> 14:24.363
Captain Obi! As soon as possible!

14:24.446 --> 14:25.531
We're rescuing him now!

14:26.699 --> 14:27.825
Calm down.

14:27.908 --> 14:30.536
So how do we rescue him?

14:30.619 --> 14:34.373
If the vision that Shinra saw is real,
then we have no time to spare.

14:34.456 --> 14:38.210
However, we need to find
where Captain Obi is being held first.

14:39.461 --> 14:43.674
For Captain Obi's location,
Joker already has that.

14:43.757 --> 14:45.509
I know the place.

14:47.803 --> 14:51.932
All heinous criminals and flight risks
in the Tokyo Empire are kept

14:52.516 --> 14:54.602
<i>in one place.</i>

14:56.896 --> 15:00.816
FUCHU PRISON

15:08.908 --> 15:11.660
<i>"God"… "Sol"…</i>

15:12.202 --> 15:14.330
<i>In that moment, in that place,</i>

15:15.414 --> 15:18.250
<i>I found an existence</i>
<i>that I could not doubt.</i>

15:25.883 --> 15:31.263
I was going to brainwash you
if you weren't obedient to us.

15:31.347 --> 15:34.391
I'm glad you were
converted and accepted us.

15:35.726 --> 15:39.313
As both a citizen and a priest,

15:39.396 --> 15:43.108
I had served Holy Sol Temple out of duty.

15:43.776 --> 15:50.074
However, in that Adolla Link,
I began to doubt the Holy Sol Temple.

15:50.658 --> 15:55.079
It is because I felt the existence
of the Evangelist, of God.

15:55.162 --> 15:57.831
I believe that the Holy Sol Temple with

15:57.915 --> 16:00.376
the Evangelist is
the true Holy Sol Temple.

16:01.919 --> 16:03.379
It is no longer duty.

16:03.879 --> 16:08.175
I saw the god in which I must have
wholehearted faith.

16:13.180 --> 16:14.556
EVANGELIST

16:14.640 --> 16:15.557
GOD
FAITH

16:15.641 --> 16:17.768
I can read minds.

16:18.268 --> 16:21.647
Doesn't seem like you're lying about that.

16:21.730 --> 16:26.360
Can you violate
the Way of Man in evangelism?

16:26.443 --> 16:29.697
A priest's role is to follow
the Way of God.

16:30.406 --> 16:34.034
Human combustion is a tribulation brought

16:34.118 --> 16:37.621
upon us for humanity to reach the Sun.

16:37.705 --> 16:41.333
Having overcome the tribulation,
humanity will become the Sun

16:41.417 --> 16:43.544
and return to the great flame.

16:43.627 --> 16:44.545
Yes.

16:45.212 --> 16:49.675
And that man has the right
to embrace that joy.

16:49.758 --> 16:52.261
Akitaru Obi…

16:58.350 --> 16:59.309
It's in your hands.

16:59.393 --> 17:01.270
We will follow soon after.

17:01.854 --> 17:02.771
Yes, sir!

17:03.355 --> 17:07.317
Then we'll head to Fuchu now,
like we planned.

17:12.781 --> 17:15.075
<i>They'll put an insect into the captain…</i>

17:22.624 --> 17:23.751
We're moving out too!

17:23.834 --> 17:24.793
Yes, sir!

17:26.336 --> 17:28.881
One gold, two gold,

17:28.964 --> 17:31.300
three gold, four gold,

17:31.800 --> 17:35.137
five gold, insect gold.

17:35.929 --> 17:40.142
Matcha ice, red bean ice, chestnut ice,

17:40.225 --> 17:42.811
chestnut mashed potatoes,
matcha mashed potatoes…

17:42.895 --> 17:44.938
insect gold.

17:48.901 --> 17:54.782
This bead of light, this face,
this insect must be it.

17:54.865 --> 17:56.909
What do you want, White-Clad?

17:57.659 --> 18:00.287
Nothing can't be bought with money.

18:00.370 --> 18:04.416
In both a psychological
and a physical sense,

18:04.500 --> 18:07.086
you can kill all you want with money.

18:07.753 --> 18:10.881
However, I do not kill for money.

18:10.964 --> 18:11.840
Why is that?

18:13.383 --> 18:17.054
To inspire despair. That's why. Cha-ching.

18:19.264 --> 18:20.808
I am Gold,

18:21.850 --> 18:23.268
a Destroyer.

18:23.352 --> 18:25.813
You think I care for your name?

18:25.896 --> 18:26.980
Hurry up and let me out of here!

18:27.064 --> 18:30.400
It is impossible to buy me with money.

18:30.984 --> 18:33.862
As for why, it is because I am Gold.

18:34.446 --> 18:36.657
You do not need to give me money.

18:36.740 --> 18:39.451
Yes, I will let you out soon.

18:39.952 --> 18:43.288
But only after
you have become an Infernal.

18:53.048 --> 18:57.136
We assembled all this equipment
in this emergency thanks to you, Vulcan.

18:57.219 --> 19:00.347
I'm an engineer! It's what I do!

19:02.558 --> 19:06.270
Arthur's equipment is just one sword.
Must be nice and light.

19:06.353 --> 19:08.063
Because I am a knight.

19:11.775 --> 19:13.068
Is there something there?

19:13.152 --> 19:14.153
The enemy?!

19:15.946 --> 19:19.825
A dragon's child?
I will let this child live.

19:19.908 --> 19:21.785
Don't scare us like that.

19:26.665 --> 19:29.626
<i>To be a dragon slayer</i>
<i>is a great honor for a knight.</i>

19:30.878 --> 19:33.839
<i>Where are you, dragon?</i>

19:37.134 --> 19:38.468
Arthur-san!

19:38.552 --> 19:40.804
Hurry up, or we'll leave you there!

19:41.388 --> 19:44.183
Are we walking all the way
to Fuchu? That'll take forever.

19:44.266 --> 19:48.812
There's a vehicle that Joker
and I use up ahead.

19:48.896 --> 19:52.816
Using a Nether Car
is the fastest way to Fuchu.

19:52.900 --> 19:55.152
So that's how he could appear
and disappear on a dime.

19:55.235 --> 19:57.070
He was going through the Nether.

19:57.154 --> 19:59.114
Can we trust Joker?

20:00.073 --> 20:02.201
You can't trust him yet?

20:02.784 --> 20:07.831
If you can trust me,
then you can trust him.

20:07.915 --> 20:10.876
He's the dark hero of Tokyo.

20:17.090 --> 20:20.469
I never thought I'd ever
join forces with you.

20:20.552 --> 20:25.682
I asked you to join us
during the Rookie Games.

20:25.766 --> 20:30.062
I knew we'd end up like this.
You took too long.

20:35.317 --> 20:37.736
I still don't trust you yet!

20:37.819 --> 20:39.071
That's fine.

20:39.154 --> 20:43.992
You shouldn't trust people
or countries or worlds that easily.

20:44.076 --> 20:46.828
Then why are you helping the 8th?

20:46.912 --> 20:49.539
The reason's very simple.

20:49.623 --> 20:54.044
You could call it the intuition
of someone who lives in the shadows.

20:54.127 --> 20:57.005
We can't afford to lose him now.

20:57.589 --> 21:00.717
Obi is a man this country needs.

21:05.847 --> 21:10.102
When you've been in the darkness
and peered into it for so long,

21:10.185 --> 21:12.604
you naturally start to understand

21:13.105 --> 21:15.565
what a true light is.

21:15.649 --> 21:17.651
Captain Obi is…

21:17.734 --> 21:21.530
It isn't the Holy Sol Temple
or the great Sol.

21:22.072 --> 21:26.118
And Obi isn't the only
light that I've found.

21:26.702 --> 21:29.663
You're one too, Shinra Kusakabe.

21:32.624 --> 21:35.210
There's a formidable foe in the prison.

21:35.294 --> 21:40.757
Leonard Burns, and the Destroyer
who killed Hague.

21:41.341 --> 21:44.386
You know how
Pillars have their Protectors?

21:45.095 --> 21:47.139
I'll protect you.

21:47.222 --> 21:48.974
I don't need your protection!

21:49.057 --> 21:50.892
I grew stronger in Asakusa.

21:51.476 --> 21:54.855
Strong enough to fight
even you and Captain Burns!

21:54.938 --> 21:58.400
Oh? Think you can beat Benimaru too?

21:58.483 --> 21:59.318
Uh, no way.

22:02.863 --> 22:04.740
That's the place.

22:04.823 --> 22:07.200
Get us in there with a bang.

22:07.284 --> 22:08.910
Don't need to tell me that!

22:10.829 --> 22:15.125
Oh? This impact… This will be fun.

22:15.208 --> 22:17.961
They seem to be quite strong.

22:20.881 --> 22:22.257
So you're here.

22:32.434 --> 22:35.270
Let's start playing hero now.

22:35.353 --> 22:36.980
I'm not playing!

22:37.064 --> 22:38.982
I'm a real hero!

22:39.066 --> 22:42.986
TO BE CONTINUED

24:13.618 --> 24:16.371
<i>After destruction comes creation.</i>

24:16.454 --> 24:18.165
<i>Destruction is not the end.</i>

24:18.248 --> 24:23.170
<i>Before God, human reason</i>
<i>is naught but egotism.</i>

24:23.253 --> 24:25.088
<i>Next time, "Embodiment of Flame."</i>

24:25.172 --> 24:27.799
<i>Return to the great flame of fire. Látom.</i>
